    <div style="max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 72px 32px 64px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px">
      <div style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #9A4A1F">02 · Regulatory &amp; Clinical Advocacy</div>
      <div style="font-size: 15px; color: #3F566C">BreakThru SCI · Co-founder, Chief Strategy &amp; Operations Officer · Aug 2025–present</div>
      <h1 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 50px); line-height: 1.12; letter-spacing: -0.025em; max-width: 1000px">Getting restorative spinal cord injury therapies to patients faster, by bringing the patient voice to Congress, the FDA and the companies building them.</h1>
      <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; color: #3F566C; max-width: 820px">I co-founded BreakThru SCI, a national patient advocacy organization working to speed restorative SCI treatments to patients. We also push for regulatory change, so SCI trials can use designs that fit how the condition actually varies from patient to patient. I lead the organization's strategy and operations, own its partnerships, run fundraising, and built and manage its board.</p>
