  <!-- WHY -->
  <section style="max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 48px 32px 8px">
    <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #F8D3BF; border-radius: 24px; padding: 32px 36px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px">
      <span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #9A4A1F">Why I started BreakThru</span>
      <p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.55; color: #12263A">When my brother suffered a spinal cord injury, I pledged my life to improving his. In his clinical trial, he and others in his cohort saw real, meaningful changes, but the trial didn't measure them, so they weren't taken seriously. We started advocating right away for regulators to account for the meaningful and variable outcomes SCI trials produce, and that became BreakThru SCI.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

