    <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #3F566C; max-width: 760px">As co-founder, I run BreakThru SCI the way an executive runs a startup: I set strategy, raise the money, build the board and close the partnerships.</p>
    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(280px, 100%), 1fr)); gap: 14px">
      <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #DCE8F3; border-radius: 18px; padding: 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px"><h3 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700">Strategy and leadership</h3><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.55; color: #3F566C">Organizational strategy and operations as we scale nationally.</p></div>
      <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #DCE8F3; border-radius: 18px; padding: 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px"><h3 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700">Finance and fundraising</h3><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.55; color: #3F566C">$175K raised toward a $900K goal; donor and investor relations, accounting, compliance and monthly budgets.</p></div>
