      <div style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #5B44B0">03 · Neurotrauma Behavioral Health Startup</div>
      <div style="font-size: 15px; color: #3F566C">Amoji · Co-founder &amp; CEO · Summer 2023–2024</div>
      <h1 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: clamp(34px, 4.4vw, 54px); line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.025em; max-width: 960px">Neurotrauma changes more than one life. We built tools for everyone it touches.</h1>
      <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; color: #3F566C; max-width: 820px">Amoji is a behavioral health startup I co-founded to support people living with neurotrauma, and their families and friends, through each phase of recovery. We validated the need with 350+ interviews, piloted two iOS products, and designed a third for the long term. As CEO, I set direction and scope for a 15-person product team alongside my co-founder and CPO, Joanne Chuang.</p>
      <div style="align-self: flex-start; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; padding: 10px 16px; border-radius: 14px; background: #FFFFFF; color: #3F566C"><strong style="color: #12263A; font-weight: 600">Status:</strong> Paused at the end of 2024 after I joined Hayden full-time. The lessons shaped my work at BreakThru SCI.</div>
