      <span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5B44B0">The insight</span>
      <p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.45">The market for neurotrauma's behavioral health impact is much larger than the number of people injured, because the impact spreads to everyone close to them.</p>
      <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; color: #3F566C">After my brother's spinal cord injury, I watched it ripple through his relationships: how he related to others, and how they related to him. I tested that idea before building anything, through discovery interviews with 350+ people with SCI, family members, friends, therapists and researchers.</p>
